<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical rated aggressive buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical rated aggressive buy.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co said Monday it is initiating coverage of FPA Medical Management Inc with an aggressive buy rating and a 12-month price target of $38 a share.</p>
<p>-- FPA shares rose one at 27-1/8.</p>
<p>-- McDonald said the price target is based on 30-times its 1998 earnings estimate of $1.25 a share.</p>
<p>-- FPA is the third largest physician practice management organization in the United States.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
